{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|$Leather Armor}}

Very basic armor that offers little protection. 

==How to acquire==

#Get [[Leather]] x8 and [[:Category:String|string]] x4.
#Use recipe from craft menu.

==Quality==

Quality of leather armor = <math>\frac{_{q}Leather+_{q}String}{2}</math> and [[Softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt{Dexterity * Sewing}</math>

==Stat Formulas==

{| class="wikitable" style="text-align: center"
!Stat
!Formula
|-
|Wear
|<math>{{Quality}} * {10}</math>
|-
|Deflection
|<math>\sqrt{\frac{_{Quality}}{10}} * {4}</math>
|-
|Absorption
|<math>\sqrt{\frac{_{Quality}}{10}} * {5}</math>
|-
|Agility Penalty
|<math>-\sqrt{\frac{Quality}{10}} * 1</math>
|}

*Agi Penalty rounded to nearest integer

